# Everything the customer zip must NOT carry.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored `vendor` or `src`
# matches at every depth and has silently stripped bundled runtime code from a
# Wbcom zip before. These entries are meant to hit the repo root only.
/.git
/.github
/.gitignore
/.gitattributes
/.editorconfig
/.distignore
/node_modules
/bin
/dist
/package.json
/package-lock.json
/gruntfile.js
/Gruntfile.js
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
.DS_Store
/developer-guide.md
/faq-guide.md
